    "%@ didn't lead straight to %@ here. Try another link." : {
      "comment" : "A link the learner drew that isn't in the story; the arguments are the cause and the effect",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ hat hier nicht direkt zu %2$@ geführt. Versuch eine andere Verbindung."
